OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 FEB
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from the Chapel of Merton
OL,6,     GCollege, Oxford on Ash Wednesday,
OL,7,     Gwith music by MacMillan, Byrd and
OL,8,     GTallis.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,10,     GRachmaninov is forced to embark
OL,11,     Gon a new full-time career as a
OL,12,     Gconcert pianist, through his
OL,13,     Gfirst months as a refugee in
OL,14,     GEurope, and his passage west
OL,15,     Gagain, to New York.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes folk
OL,18,     Gtrio The Weaving to 80A. He is
OL,19,     Galso joined by pianist Tamara
OL,20,     GStefanovich.
